  "introduction": "Build on Primary 1 knowledge and practise rounding to the nearest ten.",
  "definition": "Rounding replaces a number with a nearby multiple of ten. If the ones digit is 0–4, round down; if it is 5–9, round up. A number already ending in zero stays unchanged.",
